  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN ceasefire mediation course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN led training in ceasefire mediation. The participants are from the UN system and from different countries affected by violent conflict (parties to conflict, civil society, others). The training is organized in cooperation by the UN DPPA, Norway (MFA and the Defense college international centre - NODEFIC) and Switzerland. The purpose is for relevant actors to get insight in ceasefire mediation, and to be prepared to negotiate ceasefires in the future.</narrative>
  </description>
